        "description": "Collection for Task Management Service via BFF GraphQL\n\n✅ All requests go through: POST /graphql\n\n🌐 AWS EKS URL (set KONG_URL variable):\nhttp://a6671e74f33cd4af2be19ebf89874aa8-6be48b89dec3f532.elb.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\n\n💻 Local Minikube: http://localhost:18080\n\n📋 Flow: Login via BFF-GraphQL-API collection first → copy accessToken → paste into x-user-id header requests here",
